  "body": "Light, bright and beautifully elevated, this recently refreshed family home is ready for its next chapter. With a welcoming feel and plenty of natural light throughout, it's the perfect opportunity for first home buyers looking to get their foot on the property ladder.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen and living areas flow effortlessly outdoors, creating a fantastic setting for summer BBQs, entertaining friends or simply relaxing in the sunshine. The generous garden offers plenty of room for kids to play, pets to roam and families to enjoy.\r\n\r\nLocation is another highlight. Within walking distance of Long Bay School and Long Bay College, and with the stunning Long Bay Regional Park and beach practically on your doorstep, coastal walks, weekend swims and outdoor adventures can all become part of everyday life.\r\n\r\nFresh, inviting and ready to move straight in, this is an opportunity to secure a fantastic family home in a sought after coastal location.\r\n\r\nYour next chapter starts here.",
